LF budget discussions
---------------------

* Kevin/Guy met with LF staff to learn more about the big picture
  of how LF budgeting works.  Kevin summarized that meeting for
  the rest of the board.

* Received a budget template from LF

* Board needs to establish a budget before spending any money

* Kevin / Guy working on first budget draft.  Will be emailed to
  members for review and primary topic for next meeting


Visioning, Goals, Mission statement
-----------------------------------

* Don reviewed missions statements from other LF projects for
  general ideas, then drafted a brief mission statement
  visioning/goals document for review by board

* Main discussion around how to measure success of the project
  importance of metrics, statistics

* Maintainers / developers start to depend on KCI, require
  contributions to =E2=80=9Cpass in KernelCI=E2=80=9D before merged, etc.

* Changing mindset of kernel community to be test/CI-centric, and
  dependent on CI


